{"articleNo":"304047","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=304047&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 「2021년 RISS 및 대학라이선스 DB 온라인 이용교육」안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.03.17","hit":"8126","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-14.8pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.2pt\">한국교육학술정보원에서는 아래와 같이 온라인 생중계를 통한 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.2pt\">RISS </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.2pt\">이용교육을 실시 하오니 관심있는분들의 많은 참여</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.2pt\">&nbsp;바랍니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.2pt\">. </span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.1pt\">교 육 명</span></span></span></span><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">「</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">2021</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">RISS </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">및 대학라이선스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">DB </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">온라인 이용교육<span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">」</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">「</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">RISS 100%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">활용하고 대학과제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">A+! </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">연구성과 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">A+!</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">」</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교육대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">생 및 교수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교직원</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교육내용</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">RISS </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">우수 서포터즈와 우수 대학도서관 사서가 들려주는 들려주는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">RISS </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">이야기</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:119px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-89.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">2021</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">RISS </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">개편에 따른 서비스 사용방법 상세 안내 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-l